  "prefLabel": "Plc 803.05 Documentation Required for Initial Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 803.05 Documentation Required for Initial Registration. In addition to the information and documentation required by Plc 304.04, the applicant shall:\n\n(a) Submit proof of being 18 years old or older, in the form of an official government identification card showing date of birth or an official birth certificate.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc800.html"
